    "id": "real_marvell_newsroom_2026_11_02_marvell_and_lumentum_to_combine_creating_a_category_leader_in_a",
    "title": "Marvell and Lumentum to Combine, Creating a Category Leader in AI Connectivity",
    "signalCategory": "财报",
