    "publishedAt": "2026-09-21",
    "summary": "First 2nm demos: Demonstrations of first 2nm 400G/lane optical PAM4, first 2nm 800G ZR/ZR+ pluggable with MACsec and first 2nm 1.6T ZR and O-band coherent-lite technologies. These include the Marvell 102.4T co-packaged optics (CPO) platform, alongside additional demos developed with its partner ecosystem. First live demonstration of 2nm 800G ZR/ZR+ with MACsec: Powered by the Marvell Libra 2nm coherent DSP , the 800G ZR/ZR+ OSFP pluggable integrates media access control security (MACsec), expanding the company’s extensive coherent DSP and Marvell COLORZ® pluggable portfolios, delivering efficient, high-performance and secure optical transmission for hyperscale AI and cloud data center networks worldwide. Trusted by the world’s leading technology companies for over 30 years, we move, store, process and secure the world’s data with semiconductor solutions designed for our customers’ current needs and future ambitions.",
    "whyItMatters": "对立讯的意义在于高速互连从服务器内部延伸到光链路，需观察光器件产能、客户认证和连接方案是否改变。",
